# FSCrawler additions to the Tika component registry. Tika's ComponentRegistry merges every
# META-INF/tika/parsers.idx found on the classpath (ClassLoader.getResources), so this file
# EXTENDS — it does not replace — the index shipped by tika-vlm and the standard parsers.
# Format: component-name=fully.qualified.ClassName[:key=contextKeyClass]
openai-vlm-deterministic-parser=org.apache.tika.parser.vlm.DeterministicOpenAIVLMParser:key=org.apache.tika.parser.Parser
